### Get all blog posts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts

### Create a new blog post
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "My First Blog Post",
    "content": "This is my first blog post created using Spring Boot, Java, and MySQL. I am learning how to build REST APIs and connect them with a database."
}
### Get all blog posts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts
### Get blog post by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1

### Update blog post
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "My Updated Blog Post",
    "content": "I have successfully learned how to create and retrieve blog posts using Spring Boot, Java, REST APIs and MySQL. Now I am learning how to update existing posts."
}
### Delete blog post
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/posts/2
### Get all posts after deletion
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts